'''Commander Hannya''' (武将般若我王, ''Bushō Hannya Gaō'', '''Commander Hannya Gaō''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Hannya]] introduced in 12th Anniversary stages. It was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Commander Hannya
|image = E 705.png
|first appearance = [[Demon-Masked Lord (Veteran)]]
|money drop = 4,500¢ - 17,775¢
}}

==Enemy==
A [[Shy Boy]] wearing a Hannya-like mask with a kabuto and an eye patch. The spirit in the attack animation has horns. It has less than a quarter of Hannya's health, about 1/6th of her damage and a decreased attack rate, making Commander Hannya much less of a threat overall.

==Strategy==
With Hannya's Weaken being exchanged for a shorter [[Freeze]] and greatly reduced damage, Commander Hannya is arguably easier, since most units are likely to survive multiple attacks and can eat away at it with full strength. [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]] will steamroll Commander Hannya easily, with good choices being [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]].

